(v) the reconstruction or splitting up of a company, which ceased to be a public sector company as a result of transfer of its shares by the Central
Government, into separate companies, shall be deemed to be a demerger, if it has been made to give effect to any condition attached to the said
transfer of shares and also fulfils such other conditions as the Central Government may, by notification, specify;
