(i) any sum of money without consideration, the total of which exceeds Rs. 50000, the whole of such sum;
(ii) any immovable property—
(A) without consideration, the stamp duty value of which exceeds Rs. 50000, the stamp duty value of such property;
(B) for a consideration, the stamp duty value of such property that exceeds such consideration, if this excess amount is more than the
